      "writtenOn": "2022-11-04T16:28:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "AuthFsTestRule actually extracts the authfs tests setup/teardown part. The Host test did part of the setup inside a class setup and part as test setup, so when I extract a rule I preserved this[1]. Now the rule is used in both benchmark test and host test and the setup is a bit different. How would you like to improve it?\n\n[1] https://r.android.com/2162318",
      "parentUuid": "f990e80c_bc7ac7de",
      "revId": "bb6a3a384107d5995b5e94111a8eac283e66f35e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "eec1e503_8d847188",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
